  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 508.07 P/T Facilities Using Processed Non-Select Recyclable Materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 508.07 P/T Facilities Using Processed Non-Select Recyclable Materials. Subject to Env-Sw 508.02, no permit shall be required to collect, store, and use a processed non-select recyclable material to produce a certified waste-derived product of a type specified in Env-Sw 1503.04, Env-Sw 1503.05, or Env-Sw 1503.07.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2208.07); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14025, eff 8-1-24",
